<title>USA: Clyde-Savannah CSD, N.Y., won by Merrill Lynch.</title>
<headline>Clyde-Savannah CSD, N.Y., won by Merrill Lynch.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch &amp; Co., said it won $12.795 million of Clyde-Savannah CSD, N.Y., school district bonds, 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.18 percent.</p>
</text>
